input/: a subset of a bittensor-fetch output (11 subnets, 8 sites' pages, 8 repositories) plus synthetic edge cases: subnets 200-202 and 35.0, removed_netuids 5 and 6, site 900 (a tracking-parameter copy of a kept page, a challenge page, a Latin-1 page with CRLF line ends, a wallet-address path, a re-encoded query, a page without a file), repositories 3 (a duplicate), 901 and 902 (no README, then the same repository with a CRLF README), and removed.json in sites/ and github/. expected/ and stdout.txt: the golden subnets, subnet-sites and subnet-github runs on it, with --as-of 2026-11-11T08:45:08Z --run fixture. urls.json: each URL, its without_tracking result and whether APP_PATH matches that result's path. Read by bulk/bittensor/tests/fixtures.rs.
